usage: owned_resume.py [-h] --checkpoint CHECKPOINT --data DATA
                       [--config CONFIG]
                       [--variant {ordinary,ordinary_matched,memory_off,memory_on}]
                       [--steps STEPS] [--seed SEED] [--resume RESUME]
                       {validate,train}

Fail-closed owned-LM resume adapter; preserve the hash-bound v1 trainer. The
v1 checkpoint format and numerical training implementation remain unchanged.
Use this module for new training/resume; archived commands remain
reproducible.

positional arguments:
  {validate,train}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
  --data DATA
  --config CONFIG
  --variant {ordinary,ordinary_matched,memory_off,memory_on}
  --steps STEPS
  --seed SEED
  --resume RESUME
